<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our Captain Jesus leading us</l><l>To glory and to peace,</l><l>Defeats the devil, flesh, and sin</l><l>As on the Land we feast.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Gain Christ for Christ to be in us,</l><l>The land we all possess;</l><l>Now we respond to overcome,</l><l>Christ’s riches to express!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
